  '**Why there is a card at all.** ⚠ **Thirty-four of our forty-one escalations last year involved a promise, and in eleven of them the promise was written down and never checked against the date it named.** **Nobody had failed to do their work; there was no line anywhere saying the second check existed.**',
  '**1  Who.** **Every closure is checked by the duty supervisor before the log is signed at 16.30**, ⚠ **and every recorded promise is checked by the person who made it, seven days after the date it named.** **Two checks, two people, and the second one is the new one.**',
  '**2  With what.** **The call log and the action sheet.** ⚠ **Not the caller\'s own account on a later call** — **a caller who telephones again is describing what they remember, which is honest and is not evidence.**',
