out.push(A('⚠ **Insist on flat delivery, because the voice is the lesson here.** **A student who drops their voice on an exclusion has told the room they expect to be argued with, and they will be.** **Then put the two questions: who in your own organisation would have to close that gap, and how long has it been open?** **In this room the answer to the second has twice been longer than the writer had worked there** — **which is the moment the cycle lands, and it cannot be produced by telling them.**'));
