  '**5  Consequences.** **5.1** **A failure on 4.1 holds the carton.** **5.2** **A failure on 4.2 holds the pallet.**',
  '**6  Issue.** ⚠ **The criteria at 4 have not changed. What is new is 1, 2 and 3.2.**',
