  '**3  Definitions.** **3.1** **By _loaded_ is meant banded, sheeted and signed for by the driver, in that order.** ⚠ **3.2** **By _the bay_ is meant the covered bay only, and not the yard** — **this was the reading two of our own loaders took all winter, and the page had never said.**',
